1
00:00:00,734 --> 00:00:05,834
- What beverage do you make for that?
- Oh, no, no, no, I know this.

2
00:00:06,873 --> 00:00:10,603
(Leonard:)- Hot apple cider with cinnamon sticks?
- Hot apple cider with cinnamon sticks.

3
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:17,742
What the frig, Cooper?

4
00:00:18,318 --> 00:00:21,018
We were supposed to be in my office
half an hour ago.

5
00:00:21,188 --> 00:00:25,458
(Sheldon:)And yet now you're in my office.
Point Cooper.

6
00:00:25,826 --> 00:00:28,256
(Sheldon:)Welcome to the thunderdome, Kripke.

7
00:00:29,463 --> 00:00:32,523
We agreed to exchange copies of our work.
Let me see yours.

8
00:00:32,899 --> 00:00:35,629
Why don't you show me yours first?

9
00:00:35,902 --> 00:00:38,532
You think I just fell off the turnip truck?

10
00:00:40,073 --> 00:00:41,563
(Kripke:)We exchange at the same time.

11
00:00:42,476 --> 00:00:45,876
(Sheldon:)How do I know you're not going
to take my ideas and publish them?

12
00:00:46,046 --> 00:00:47,746
How do I know you're not gonna?

13
00:00:47,914 --> 00:00:51,574
Yeah, because I'm not interested
in getting published in MAD Magazine.

14
00:00:53,019 --> 00:00:55,679
The zingers fly fast
in the thunderdome, Barry.

15
00:00:56,189 --> 00:00:58,279
Are we gonna do this or not?

